title: "PramaanGrid: Algorithmic Proof-of-Clearance and Anti-Fraud Escrow Protocol for Indian Municipalities"
abstract: "Open-source civic trust and anti-fraud infrastructure designed for urban municipal waste management, featuring bi-temporal VLM landmark verification, GPS spoofing mitigation, and automated escrow settlement."
